prompt.text:
Implement a new project snapshot function with this exact API:

export interface Initiative { id: number; name: string }
export interface Checkpoint { id: number; initiativeId: number; dueDay: number; label: string }
export interface InitiativeSnapshot { initiative: Initiative; checkpoints: Checkpoint[] }
export function createInitiativeSnapshot(initiativeId: number, initiatives: readonly Initiative[], checkpoints: readonly Checkpoint[]): InitiativeSnapshot

initiativeId must be a positive integer or RangeError is thrown. Find the initiative with exactly that id; throw RangeError if none exists or if more than one exists. Include only checkpoints whose initiativeId matches. Sort them by ascending dueDay and then ascending id. Return copies of the initiative and checkpoints without mutating or retaining aliases to either input array. An initiative with no checkpoints produces an empty array. Values such as negative dueDay are valid and participate normally in ordering.

Return only the complete source file; do not include Markdown fences or prose.

